---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Careers | JayTech9"
  description="Work at JayTech9. See open roles in support, engineering, design and data, or send your CV for future vacancies."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Careers</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        JayTech9 is growing. As we take on more clients, we’ll be adding support agents, developers, designers
        and more.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="section openings-section" aria-labelledby="openings-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="openings-heading">Open roles</h2>
      <div class="card empty">
        <span class="icon-badge">
          <svg
            class="icon"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            aria-hidden="true"
            focusable="false"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16" />
            <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <p class="empty__title">Currently, there is no open vacancy.</p>
        <p>
          We’re always glad to hear from talented people. Send your CV to{' '}
          <a href="mailto:info@jaytech9.com?subject=Future%20roles%20at%20JayTech9">info@jaytech9.com</a> and
          we’ll keep it on file for future roles.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--band" aria-labelledby="teams-heading">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="teams-heading">Teams we’re building</h2>
      <ul class="card-grid teams">
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Zm0 0a9 9 0 1 1 18 0m0 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z" />
              <path d="M21 16v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-5" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Customer Support</h3>
          <p>
            The first voice our clients hear. Answering questions, solving problems and making sure nothing
            falls through the cracks.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6" />
              <path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Engineering</h3>
          <p>Building and maintaining websites, business systems and our own products.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="m18 13-.654-4.736a4 4 0 00-2.756-3.266l-9.163-2.9a2 2 0 00-2.017.493l-.82.819a2 2 0 00-.492 2.017l2.9 9.163a4 4 0 003.266 2.756L13 18" />
              <path d="M18.648 12.352a1.205 1.205 0 011.704 0l1.296 1.296a1.205 1.205 0 010 1.704l-6.296 6.296a1.205 1.205 0 01-1.704 0l-1.296-1.296a1.205 1.205 0 010-1.704z" />
              <path d="m3 3 6.586 6.586" />
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Design</h3>
          <p>Brand, interface and print design for clients and for JayTech9.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="card">
          <span class="icon-badge">
            <svg
              class="icon"
              width="24"
              height="24"
              aria-hidden="true"
              focusable="false"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"

              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M14 9.536V7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h1.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5V5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4 4 4 0 0 0-4 4c0 2 1 3 1 5a5 5 0 0 1-1 3" />
              <path d="M4 9a5 5 0 0 1 8 4 5 5 0 0 1-8-4" />
              <path d="M5 21h14" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h3>Data &amp; AgriTech</h3>
          <p>Field data, dashboards and analysis, including our work with smallholder farmers.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .openings-section h2,
  .section--band h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .empty {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .empty__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .job__main p {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }
  .job__meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    display: grid;
  }
  .job__meta dt {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .job__meta dd {
    margin: 0.1rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
